@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> OffState

state "Off" as OffState
state "Alarm Activated" as AlarmActivated
state "Ringing" as Ringing

OffState : entry/Initialize system
OffState : do/Set alarm time
OffState : exit/Do nothing

AlarmActivated : entry/Alarm set
AlarmActivated : do/Wait for current time to match alarm time
AlarmActivated : exit/Do nothing

Ringing : entry/Ring the alarm
Ringing : do/Play alarm sound
Ringing : exit/Stop ringing

OffState --> AlarmActivated : Set alarm time
AlarmActivated --> Ringing : Current time matches alarm time
Ringing --> OffState : Stop alarm

@enduml
